{"title":"Wanna Sit Down? You Gotta Solve The Rubik&#8217;s Cube Chair.","link":"https://kottke.org/25/07/wanna-sit-down-you-gotta-solve-the-rubiks-cube-chair","date":1751500619000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"a small chair with four legs attached to a Rubik's Cube\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"someone trying to solve the Rubik's Cube chair\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rubiks-chair-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"an unsolved Rubik's Cube chair sitting on the ground\" /></p>\n\n<p>If you want to sit in this chair, you have to be able to solve a Rubik’s Cube because <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DIWnTgYtduL/\">the chair is a Rubik’s Cube</a>. (Ok, technically it looks like you only need to place the four leg corners of the chair correctly, but we’re not going to pick nits on this because it is fun and loooorrrrrrrd do we all need some fun right now.)</p>\n\n<p>Oh and I like how the unsolved chair in the last photo looks like it’s striking a break dancing pose. Fresh! (via <a href=\"https://mossandfog.com/rubiks-cube-chair-makes-you-work-for-your-seat/\">moss &amp; fog</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/furniture\">furniture</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/games\">games</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Rubik%27s%20Cube\">Rubik’s Cube</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/07/wanna-sit-down-you-gotta-solve-the-rubiks-cube-chair\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"28935e7f3e0fc12fe582c90410f246eb1be3933bb6c5aa32589e533cf7cdfcdc","category":"Sites"}